Models

Concertina uses the Bard-VL vision-language backbone, which this repository references but does not contain.

  Bard-VL -- MIT License (per its model card)
      https://huggingface.co/fudan-generative-ai/Bard-VL-B4-Mask-4B-Instruct
      https://fudan-generative-vision.github.io/Bard-VL, https://huggingface.co/papers/2604.16514
  Qwen3-VL -- Apache License 2.0 (Bard-VL is converted from Qwen3-VL)
      https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL

===============================================================================
LeRobot -- Apache License 2.0
Copyright 2024 The HuggingFace Inc. team. All rights reserved.
https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot

  src/concertina/train/factories.py
      `make_dataloaders` adapts `make_dataloaders` of lerobot/scripts/lerobot_train.py (commit
      2b8aeee410753fcfaa44ec259707474bf6141b62). Modified: the Concertina weighted mixture sampler replaces the
      episode-aware sampler, and a resumed run restores the sampler position.
  src/concertina/data/stats.py
      `aggregate_feature_stats` adapts `aggregate_feature_stats` of lerobot/datasets/compute_stats.py.
      Modified: pools offline rotation-statistics files and averages quantiles with count weights.
  src/concertina/data/rotation.py
      The rotation conversions adapt `mat2quat`, `quat2axisangle`, `rotate6d_to_axis_angle` and
      `mat_to_rotate6d` of lerobot/policies/xvla/utils.py (LeRobot's port of X-VLA, see below). Modified:
      batched NumPy/PyTorch wrappers around the per-element conversions, and the inverse conversions to Euler
      angles and quaternions.

===============================================================================
Hugging Face Transformers -- Apache License 2.0
Copyright 2025 The Qwen Team and The HuggingFace Inc. team. All rights reserved.
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

  src/concertina/model/liger.py
      `_liger_rope_attention_forward` adapts `Qwen3VLTextAttention.forward` of
      src/transformers/models/qwen3_vl/modeling_qwen3_vl.py (transformers 5.5.4). Modified: the attention
      forward applies Liger-Kernel's rotary-embedding kernel.
  src/concertina/model/backbone.py
      `QwenVLBackbone._expand_image_tokens` adapts the image-placeholder expansion of
      `Qwen3VLProcessor.__call__` of src/transformers/models/qwen3_vl/processing_qwen3_vl.py. Modified: expands
      the image placeholders of one prompt from cached image grids.

